<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" data-bs-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Aguardando aprovação — BiblioMap</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: #0d1117;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .pending-card {
            background: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 52px 48px;
            max-width: 520px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            animation: fadeUp .4s ease both;
        }
        @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px) } to { opacity:1; transform:none } }
        .pending-icon {
            width: 80px; height: 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0883e22, #d2992222);
            border: 2px solid rgba(210,153,34,.35);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
            font-size: 36px;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(210,153,34,.25); }
            50%       { box-shadow: 0 0 0 16px rgba(210,153,34,0); }
        }
        h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #e6edf3; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        p  { font-size: 15px; color: #8b949e; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .highlight { color: #d29922; font-weight: 600; }
        .steps {
            background: #0d1117;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin: 28px 0;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .step {
            display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;
        }
        .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .step-num {
            width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(79,142,247,.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(79,142,247,.3);
            color: #4f8ef7;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .step-num.done { background: rgba(63,185,80,.15); border-color: rgba(63,185,80,.3); color: #3fb950; }
        .step-text { font-size: 13.5px; color: #8b949e; padding-top: 3px; }
        .step-text strong { color: #e6edf3; }
        .btn-back {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 10px;
            background: transparent; border: 1px solid #30363d;
            color: #8b949e; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none; transition: all .2s;
        }
        .btn-back:hover { border-color: #4f8ef7; color: #4f8ef7; }
        .badge-pending {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(210,153,34,.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(210,153,34,.3);
            color: #d29922; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="pending-card">
    <div class="pending-icon">⏳</div>

    <div class="badge-pending">
        <i class="bi bi-hourglass-split"></i>
        Aguardando moderação
    </div>

    <h1>Cadastro em análise</h1>
    <p>
        Sua conta foi criada com sucesso! Agora basta aguardar enquanto nossa equipe
        <span class="highlight">revisa e aprova</span> o seu acesso à plataforma.
    </p>

    <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num done"><i class="bi bi-check"></i></div>
            <div class="step-text"><strong>Cadastro realizado</strong><br>Seus dados foram registrados.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">2</div>
            <div class="step-text"><strong>Análise do administrador</strong><br>Seu perfil está em análise. Pode levar até 48h.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num" style="opacity:.4">3</div>
            <div class="step-text" style="opacity:.5"><strong>Acesso liberado</strong><br>Você receberá acesso completo à plataforma.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn-back">
        <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Voltar ao login
    </a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
